00:12:27,600 --> 00:12:32,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Trembling at the sight of blood,
why would you, one of the Sannin,</font>

134
00:12:33,230 --> 00:12:37,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">risk your life to protect that Genin kid?</font>

135
00:12:50,450 --> 00:12:52,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To protect...</font>

136
00:12:53,660 --> 00:12:56,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my hometown... the Leaf Village...!</font>

137
00:13:01,670 --> 00:13:03,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To protect the Leaf Village...?</font>

138
00:13:14,060 --> 00:13:16,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because... because...</font>

139
00:13:18,190 --> 00:13:19,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this small child...</font>

140
00:13:20,940 --> 00:13:23,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is the kid who will become
Hokage some day...</font>

141
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:28,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What utter nonsense...</font>

142
00:13:29,660 --> 00:13:33,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way...
to hell with Hokage!</font>

143
00:13:33,750 --> 00:13:35,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only a fool does that job.</font>

144
00:13:37,710 --> 00:13:41,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To hell with Hokage!
Only a fool does that job.</font>

145
00:13:48,640 --> 00:13:50,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The wishes of the two...</font>

146
00:13:50,930 --> 00:13:55,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly, Tsunade-sama,
your wish...</font>

147
00:13:56,020 --> 00:13:57,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Have you forgotten your dream?</font>

148
00:14:03,320 --> 00:14:05,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The successive lines of Hokage
have protected</font>

149
00:14:05,490 --> 00:14:08,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Leaf Village and
and those living in it.</font>

150
00:14:09,110 --> 00:14:12,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They brought troubled times under control
and helped the village to prosper.</font>

151
00:14:12,950 --> 00:14:15,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They risked their lives
for this dream, this ideal!</font>

152
00:14:20,500 --> 00:14:24,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Anyone who makes fun of the old man
and the Fourth Hokage...</font>

153
00:14:24,250 --> 00:14:26,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't matter if
you are a woman!</font>

154
00:14:26,920 --> 00:14:28,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll beat you with everything I have!</font>

155
00:14:39,520 --> 00:14:44,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And now,
I also will put my life on the line!</font>

156
00:14:47,610 --> 00:14:51,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If your life is worth throwing away
for a kid like him...!</font>

157
00:14:52,200 --> 00:14:55,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then dying now would be
a fitting end!</font>

158
00:15:15,100 --> 00:15:17,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All that's left... is Naruto-kun.</font>

159
00:15:18,850 --> 00:15:19,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama!</font>

160
00:15:23,560 --> 00:15:24,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Make it in time!</font>

161
00:15:36,950 --> 00:15:40,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's still able to move even
after I pierced her down to her lungs!</font>

162
00:15:49,420 --> 00:15:52,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You mean you'll still protect that kid?!</font>

163
00:15:56,220 --> 00:15:57,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what I said...</font>

164
00:15:58,310 --> 00:15:59,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From now...</font>

165
00:16:01,940 --> 00:16:04,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm putting my life on the line!</font>

166
00:16:05,560 --> 00:16:07,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You, half-dead corpse!</font>

167
00:16:21,250 --> 00:16:26,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how cool you try to be,
your trembling doesn't stop.</font>

168
00:16:26,880 --> 00:16:30,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't get away from
the curse of hemophobia.</font>

169
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:37,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And yet, why would you
take the blows for that kid?</font>

170
00:16:38,220 --> 00:16:42,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why would you battle for the Leaf?</font>

171
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:54,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

172
00:16:54,780 --> 00:16:56,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade's trembling has...</font>

173
00:16:57,240 --> 00:16:58,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">has stopped?</font>

174
00:17:00,370 --> 00:17:03,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is because... I am...</font>

175
00:17:07,750 --> 00:17:11,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Leaf Village's... Fifth Hokage!</font>

176
00:17:13,130 --> 00:17:14,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That sign is?!</font>

177
00:17:15,970 --> 00:17:18,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama has conquered
her fear of blood,</font>

178
00:17:18,260 --> 00:17:19,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but that's...</font>

179
00:17:23,560 --> 00:17:26,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you saying you'll do,
after all this time?</font>

180
00:17:26,810 --> 00:17:33,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't fight with that wound
even if you've conquered your fear.</font>

181
00:17:38,320 --> 00:17:44,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-Wait! I'll treat that wound.
So don't release that seal!</font>

182
00:17:48,080 --> 00:17:49,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade: Release the Secret Seal!</font>

183
00:17:50,250 --> 00:17:53,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Mitotic Regeneration!</font>

184
00:18:09,980 --> 00:18:11,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is this Jutsu...?!</font>

185
00:18:16,650 --> 00:18:21,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like I'm not the only one
who develops new Jutsu.</font>

186
00:18:21,950 --> 00:18:25,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What in the world is this Jutsu?</font>

187
00:18:25,620 --> 00:18:26,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

188
00:18:27,660 --> 00:18:31,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For many years I've stored Chakra
in my forehead.</font>

189
00:18:32,670 --> 00:18:36,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The mass of Chakra stimulated
a variety of proteins.</font>

190
00:18:37,090 --> 00:18:40,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The number of times my cells divide
speeds to a dizzying rate...</font>

191
00:18:41,010 --> 00:18:42,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The cells rebuild...</font>

192
00:18:43,430 --> 00:18:47,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and all the organs and body systems
are revitalized.</font>

193
00:18:48,230 --> 00:18:51,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not the ability to restore,
it's the ability to reincarnate.</font>

194
00:18:52,110 --> 00:18:55,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That means I won't die... from battles.</font>

195
00:18:58,030 --> 00:19:02,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the number of times a person's cells
divide in their lifetime is fixed...</font>

196
00:19:02,700 --> 00:19:07,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If that is sped up,
it essentially shortens the life!</font>

197
00:19:10,500 --> 00:19:11,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama!</font>

198
00:19:13,340 --> 00:19:14,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That action is...</font>

199
00:19:15,170 --> 00:19:16,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama!</font>

200
00:19:19,420 --> 00:19:20,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come out!</font>

201
00:19:22,590 --> 00:19:23,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry!</font>

202
00:19:24,970 --> 00:19:27,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino, inu, saru, Tori, hitsuji!</font>

203
00:19:29,430 --> 00:19:30,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Summoning Jutsu!
— Summoning Jutsu!
— Summoning Jutsu!</font>

204
00:21:05,650 --> 00:21:10,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I BELIEVE YOUR PROMISE ITS TRUE HEART TO GIVE ME COURAGE</b></font></font>

205
00:21:05,650 --> 00:21:10,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I believe your promise, it's a true heart gives me courage</b></font></font>

206
00:21:10,650 --> 00:21:15,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

207
00:21:10,650 --> 00:21:15,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

208
00:21:15,620 --> 00:21:20,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>tachidomatta kado ni</b></font></font>

209
00:21:15,620 --> 00:21:20,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>on your still shoulder</b></font></font>

210
00:21:20,430 --> 00:21:25,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>asu e mukau kaze wo kanjiteta</b></font></font>

211
00:21:20,430 --> 00:21:25,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I feel the wind that blows towards tomorrow</b></font></font>

212
00:21:25,060 --> 00:21:31,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>machi no akari hoshikuzu mitai ni</b></font></font>

213
00:21:25,060 --> 00:21:31,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>the city lights are like pieces of stars</b></font></font>

214
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:35,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>futari tsutsumu kedo</b></font></font>

215
00:21:31,000 --> 00:21:35,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>that hold us together</b></font></font>

216
00:21:35,670 --> 00:21:44,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>sorezore ni chigau kagayaki ga aru to</b></font></font>

217
00:21:35,670 --> 00:21:44,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>"each one of us glows differently"</b></font></font>

218
00:21:44,980 --> 00:21:47,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>warau kimi ga</b></font></font>

219
00:21:44,980 --> 00:21:47,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you say laughingly</b></font></font>

220
00:21:47,860 --> 00:21:54,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ichiban mabushiku mieru yo</b></font></font>

221
00:21:47,860 --> 00:21:54,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>but you look most dazzling</b></font></font>

222
00:21:54,130 --> 00:21:58,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>yume wa ryuusei no you ni</b></font></font>

223
00:21:54,130 --> 00:21:58,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like a comet</b></font></font>

224
00:21:58,560 --> 00:22:04,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ameagari no niji no you ni</b></font></font>

225
00:21:58,560 --> 00:22:04,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like the rainbow after the storm</b></font></font>

226
00:22:04,710 --> 00:22:12,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>kono kokoro ni hikari wo tsuretekuru</b></font></font>

227
00:22:04,710 --> 00:22:12,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you bring light into my heart</b></font></font>

228
00:22:12,910 --> 00:22:23,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>nayami tsuzukeru koto ga hitotsu no kotae ni naruyo</b></font></font>

229
00:22:12,910 --> 00:22:23,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>being lost can be the answer</b></font></font>

230
00:22:23,590 --> 00:22:31,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>gomakashitari shinai to chikau no</b></font></font>

231
00:22:23,590 --> 00:22:31,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>let's promise we won't cheat</b></font></font>

232
00:22:31,030 --> 00:22:35,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

233
00:22:31,030 --> 00:22:35,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

234
00:22:38,120 --> 00:22:42,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">The time to conclude this long, fateful
confrontation has come, Orochimaru.</font>

235
00:22:42,750 --> 00:22:45,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You have sunk too deeply into vice.</font>

236
00:22:45,380 --> 00:22:47,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">You are no longer a comrade!</font>

237
00:22:47,920 --> 00:22:51,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Comrade? How repulsive.</font>

238
00:22:51,640 --> 00:22:54,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">That word makes me shiver.</font>

239
00:22:54,430 --> 00:22:56,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I will bring you down!</font>

240
00:22:56,470 --> 00:22:59,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Today is the last day that
we are called Sannin!</font>

241
00:23:00,230 --> 00:23:02,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"The Three-Way Deadlock Battle."</font>

